  "steps": [
    "Soften the onion, carrot and celery in the oil. Add the meat and brown it well.",
    "Add the wine and let it evaporate, then the passata. Simmer covered on low heat for 1½–2 hours, adding water if it dries out.",
    "For the béchamel, melt the butter, stir in the flour, then whisk in the warm milk a little at a time. Cook until thick and season with salt and nutmeg.",
    "In a baking dish, layer béchamel, sheets, ragù, béchamel and parmesan; repeat, finishing with ragù, béchamel and parmesan.",
    "Bake at 180 °C for 35–40 minutes and rest for 10 minutes before cutting."
  ]
